GrokZen (repository codename: grok-zh)
======================================

An independent, community-maintained distribution of SpaceXAI Grok Build.
This project is not affiliated with SpaceXAI or with the maintainers of the
upstream repositories listed below.

Copyright and license notices
-----------------------------

Copyright 2023-2026 SpaceXAI (see LICENSE, Apache License 2.0).

This derivative work incorporates code and changes from the following
open-source projects, each licensed under the Apache License 2.0:

- xai-org/grok-build
  Official upstream of Grok Build by SpaceXAI.
  https://github.com/xai-org/grok-build

- JoyElliot/grok-build-Chinese
  Unofficial Simplified Chinese community localization of Grok Build.
  Provides the Chinese UI/translations and the grok-zh compatibility naming
  (shared ~/.grok, GROK_HOME) used by this project.
  https://github.com/JoyElliot/grok-build-Chinese

- thedavidweng/gork-build (Gork Build)
  Community distribution of Grok Build with vendor telemetry removed.
  Provides the telemetry-off approach applied here: Mixpanel/product event
  reporting hard-disabled, GCS research/session-trace upload paths disabled,
  remote feature-flag re-enable paths blocked, and vendor auto-update
  hard-disabled (this build never installs from x.ai update channels).
  https://github.com/thedavidweng/gork-build

Changes made by this project on top of the above include merging the
telemetry-off patch into the Chinese localization, repository
independence/rebranding, and continued syncing with the official upstream.

See README.md, THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES, and the per-directory third-party
license files for further attribution.
